abstract: >-
  Author-developed code, original figures, eligible aggregate outputs,
  portable manifests, and audit records for a reconstruction and exploratory
  evaluation of tumour-microenvironment-associated gene-pair scores in breast
  cancer. Record-level derivatives and frozen model objects are not redistributed.

